WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:16.135
Tina: What was that?

2
00:00:16.136 --> 00:00:18.574
No. I have to get to Hopian.

3
00:00:18.575 --> 00:00:20.897
I have to concentrate.

4
00:00:20.898 --> 00:00:23.064
Tina: I need to be brave.

5
00:00:23.065 --> 00:00:28.359
I need to be strong.

6
00:00:28.360 --> 00:00:31.099
Tina: What would Hopian tell me?

7
00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.866
Hopian: You can do it, Tina.

8
00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.897
Hopian: Run as fast as the wind.

9
00:00:36.898 --> 00:00:39.279
Take giant leaps.

10
00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.215
Hopian: Take giant leaps of imagination.

11
00:00:44.216 --> 00:00:48.534
Tina: Giant leaps . . . leaps of imagination.

12
00:00:48.535 --> 00:00:52.136
Hopian: Leap and run like the wind.

13
00:00:52.137 --> 00:00:55.127
Hopian: Your belief will lead you to me.

14
00:00:55.128 --> 00:00:58.256
Your belief is your strength.

15
00:00:58.257 --> 00:00:59.853
Tina: I do believe!

16
00:00:59.854 --> 00:01:04.493
I am fast! I am strong!

17
00:01:04.494 --> 00:01:07.906
Tina: One . . . two . . . three!

18
00:01:07.907 --> 00:01:10.673
Faster, Tina, faster!

19
00:01:10.674 --> 00:01:11.977
Tina: I can do it.

20
00:01:11.978 --> 00:01:14.181
I can do it.

21
00:01:14.182 --> 00:01:19.719
Tina: A giant leap . . . a leap of imagination.

22
00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:25.934
Tina: Whee! This is incredible!

23
00:01:25.935 --> 00:01:29.138
Tina: I'm back! I'm back!

24
00:01:29.139 --> 00:01:31.596
I can't believe it!

25
00:01:31.597 --> 00:01:33.545
Tina: I remember this tree.

26
00:01:33.546 --> 00:01:40.157
I know how to get to Ginormous from here! Ha!

27
00:01:40.158 --> 00:01:49.071
Tina: If only Brad and Danny could see me now! Whoo-hoo!

28
00:01:49.072 --> 00:01:56.846
Tina: This is more fun than Disneyland!

29
00:01:56.847 --> 00:02:02.242
Tina: It's time to swim!

30
00:02:02.243 --> 00:02:09.011
Tina: Now it's time for another leap of imagination.

31
00:02:09.012 --> 00:02:13.689
Tina: Uh-oh, I don't want to spend too much time in this world!

32
00:02:13.690 --> 00:02:19.186
Tina: I have to leap again before I freeze!

33
00:02:19.187 --> 00:02:22.408
Tina: Go! Faster, faster!

34
00:02:22.409 --> 00:02:25.982
I'm getting tired, but I have to keep running.

35
00:02:25.983 --> 00:02:28.470
Hopian: Take a giant leap.

36
00:02:28.471 --> 00:02:31.759
Take a leap of imagination.

37
00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:36.664
Tina: I . . . can . . . do . . . it!

38
00:02:36.665 --> 00:02:41.036
Tina: Ow! I think I twisted my ankle.

39
00:02:41.037 --> 00:02:45.793
Tina: I just have to make one more leap, and I should be in Ginormous.

40
00:02:45.794 --> 00:02:48.917
Tina: Ouch, that hurts!

41
00:02:48.918 --> 00:02:55.011
How am I going to run now?

42
00:02:55.012 --> 00:02:57.185
Brad: Look at the rainbows.

43
00:02:57.186 --> 00:03:00.265
The diamonds are acting like prisms.

44
00:03:00.266 --> 00:03:02.029
Danny: What's a prism?

45
00:03:02.030 --> 00:03:04.611
Brad: It's a triangle-shaped glass.

46
00:03:04.612 --> 00:03:08.086
It separates light into the different colors─

47
00:03:08.087 --> 00:03:11.422
Danny: A rainbow!

48
00:03:11.423 --> 00:03:13.385
Tina: The rainbow will get me there!

49
00:03:13.386 --> 00:03:16.582
Tina: Brad showed us how a diamond acts like a prism.

50
00:03:16.583 --> 00:03:20.037
Tina: It separates light into a rainbow.

51
00:03:20.038 --> 00:03:29.933
I need to find a big diamond.

52
00:03:29.934 --> 00:03:32.477
Tina: Now, just one more leap.

53
00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:36.524
It won't be a very big jump, but I have to try.

54
00:03:36.525 --> 00:03:41.917
Tina: Here I go!

55
00:03:41.918 --> 00:03:47.233
Tina: I don't think I went very far.

56
00:03:47.234 --> 00:03:52.340
Tina: I made it!
